1
00:00:00,592 --> 00:00:03,222
(Raj:)Boy, all this standing's
making me tired.

2
00:00:03,228 --> 00:00:07,098
(Raj:)Good thing I brought
my collapsible stick chair.

3
00:00:07,098 --> 00:00:09,698
(Howard:)Not the stick chair.

4
00:00:09,701 --> 00:00:11,471
(Howard:)You look like an idiot
on that thing.

5
00:00:11,469 --> 00:00:13,839
(Raj:)Sticks and stones
may break my bones,

6
00:00:13,838 --> 00:00:16,738
(Raj:)but chairs on sticks
are comfy.

7
00:00:17,609 --> 00:00:19,339
(Leonard:)Hey.
Hey.

8
00:00:19,344 --> 00:00:21,514
(Sheldon:)Is everything
smoothed out with Amy?

9
00:00:21,513 --> 00:00:23,383
(Stuart:)Uh, no, she's still pretty mad.

10
00:00:23,381 --> 00:00:26,721
(Sheldon:)Did you make the apology
as sincere as I would have?

11
00:00:26,718 --> 00:00:29,348
(Stuart:)I said,
“Sheldon says he's sorry.”

12
00:00:29,354 --> 00:00:32,254
(Sheldon:)Oh, well, that's
laying it on a little thick.

13
00:00:34,192 --> 00:00:36,922
(Leonard:)You think it's time you
apologize to her yourself?

14
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:38,498
(sighs)
I suppose so.

15
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:40,386
(Sheldon:)But if I get out of the line,
I'll lose my spot.

16
00:00:40,386 --> 00:00:42,986
(Stuart:)I'm happy to hold your place
till you get back.

17
00:00:42,988 --> 00:00:44,288
(Sheldon:)You would do that?

18
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:46,660
(Stuart:)Consider it my way
of getting more of your money.

19
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:50,523
(Sheldon:)You're a good man.

20
00:00:51,664 --> 00:00:53,294
(Bernadette:)So, Beverly,
did you know Penny

21
00:00:53,299 --> 00:00:54,969
(Bernadette:)is the number
three sales rep

22
00:00:54,967 --> 00:00:56,567
(Bernadette:)at our pharmaceutical company?

23
00:00:56,569 --> 00:00:58,599
(Beverly:)Oh, I didn't realize
you two work together.

